# The control for ring-fire-shards.keys: wearing the same fire ring, shoot
# yourself with a wand of COLD damage, which is the one type the ring's curse
# is supposed to amplify. Read by tools/check_ring_fire_curse.sh, finding
# PA-08-F2 of bd inc-tek.8.8.
#
# Identical to ring-fire-shards.keys but for the wand: the run stops on "Wand
# of Scouring", the entry after Ice in lib/m_items.irh.

@include ring-fire-curse.keys

w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*4
@until "Wand of Scouring" DOWN
ENTER
2
ENTER
@dump:wand-in-hand
s
ESC
b
a
*
@dump:shot1
b
a
*
@dump:shot2
